Alembic migrations for Digital Village.

    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head     # apply
    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "message"
    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini downgrade -1     # roll back one revision

The first revision also enables the required PostgreSQL extensions
(vector, pg_trgm) and creates the HNSW vector indexes.
